 " options are passed on."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"37bd175a-5aae-49f3-a81f-1ddb59ebb86b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The construction uses the current random state, so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SeedRandom"]], "paclet:ref/SeedRandom"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
